  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This impeccably maintained home on the boardwalk just steps to the beach, is perfect for friends and family who want to enjoy a getaway to Rosemary Beach in grand style. The overall comfortable casualness of this home features expansive living space to include dining, kitchen, and two separate seating areas, all flowing out to the wrap around balconies and view of the ocean. AS A REMINDER DUE TO THE MULIT LEVEL DESIGN AND STONE STAIRWAYS ABSOLUTELY NO CHILDREN ALLOWED UNDER 10 YEARS OF AGE ARE PERMITTED.<br> No expense was spared when designing this home. The culinary style chefs kitchen is fully equipped to prepare your favorite meal. Should you choose to grill there is a gas Weber located on the side balcony off the kitchen. Additionally this home features custom cabinets and Thermador, Bosh, and Fisher Pikel appliances including two dishwashers. The floors are all natural stone and the countertops are a beautiful Tuscan style white marble. This living area includes a 55\" Smart TV, to enjoy your favorite movie.<br> Entering the home from the lush courtyard, you will notice the unique design. The expansive first level with steps leading to one of the two private master bedrooms can also accommodate a separate getaway area for those wanting a bit of quiet time. This multi level design features two king master suites with adjoining bath and a secluded loft style bunk area accessible via a separate set of steps therefore no door is required, that sleeps three with adjoining bath and walk in shower. All bedrooms have TV's and spacious closet space. A larger laundry room with sink is also featured on this level.This space opens onto another beautiful courtyard and large seating area.<br> A real plus on the south side is the two car parking garage. The third floor level is not included in the rental. <br> This home is part of The All Seasons Collection 30A www.allseasons30a.com. A boutique property management company exclusively featuring Rosemary Beach homes.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
